$ stats
renderer   off  draw calls, passes, state changes, uploads and memory per frame
gpu        off  GPU time of every pass
pass       off  draws, triangles and state changes per pass
pipeline   off  sets, switches and draws per pipeline
bindgroup  off  bind group sets and changes per pass and slot
buffer     off  live buffers and uploads per usage
compute    off  dispatches and workgroups per compute pass
systems    off  the ten slowest ECS systems of the frame

$ stats renderer
renderer panel on

$ stats gpu on
gpu panel on

$ stats pass
pass panel on

$ stats pipeline
pipeline panel on

$ stats bindgroup
bindgroup panel on

$ stats buffer
buffer panel on

$ stats compute
compute panel on

$ stats systems
systems panel on

